      "content": "that's a good start. could u go a bit deeper into the liberal side though? i want to make sure i'm capturing the full philosophical depth of their position for my paper. like, what are the specific theological or ethical frameworks they use to justify why compassion might override the sanctity of life? it feels like a really complex, nuanced position.",
